When `sfAssetsTotal` is mid-grid (>16 significant digits, e.g. from loan operations), rounding both `totalBefore` and `totalAfter` under the same mode can produce a delta **larger** than the input `|delta|`. E.g., T=10000000000000005, W=6, Upward: `round_up(T)-round_up(T-6)=10000000000000010-9999999999999999=11>6`. This contradicts the callers' safety assumptions.
